  click W_CANCEL href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/CompleteTaskIntent.swift#L128" "cancelPendingNudges(for:defaults:). pendingNotificationRequests, then removePendingNotificationRequests for ids with prefix nudge.arb. that contain the task UUID (prep, floater, placementLead, placementMissed); trims those ids from nudge.arb.scheduledIDs; sets nudge.arb.widgetMutated. The widget cannot run the arbiter, so kinds that only name the task (the morning prompt) wait for the app." _blank
